    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0116" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>

                <head>Earl Russell to Mr.
                        Adams</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foreign Office,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 2, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Lord Russell presents his compliments to Mr. Adams, and wishing to be quite
                    assured of his correctness of his report of the conversation he held with Mr.
                    Adams on Wednesday last, the 28th ultimo, has the honor to transmit to him the
                    accompanying copy of the despatch which he has addressed to Mr. Burnley, her
                    Majesty’s chargé d’affaires at Washington.</p>
            </div>
